{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_system_how_glue_works", "label": "GLUE: how it works now (SYSTEM)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The one place that says how GLUE works today. ADRs say why, one decision each. A change that alters how GLUE works updates this file in the same commit."}, {"id": "vault_system_pieces", "label": "Four pieces: website, GLUE folder, GLUE Home, GLUE Cloud", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The website works alone, offline and without an account. GLUE Cloud holds the account's collections, profiles and devices, never music."}, {"id": "vault_system_glue_folder", "label": "GLUE folder: JSON files, no database", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSON files, no database (ADR 0009). Lowercase mco names are kept because existing data, backups and settings depend on them."}, {"id": "vault_system_track_model", "label": "Song (Track) record", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "status is linked, missing or unlinked; rootId and relPath place a song in a music folder; fileKey is used for copies; sources are the DJ libraries it came from."}, {"id": "vault_system_no_file_relink", "label": "No file linked: records matched to library songs", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Songs with no file are matched by name, a certainty each, then linked so a new read of the DJ library keeps them linked (ADR 0124)."}, {"id": "vault_system_away_folder", "label": "Music folder away, not gone", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A music folder that cannot be reached is not marked missing, analysed, rescanned or written into; its songs wait for it (ADR 0123)."}, {"id": "vault_system_caches", "label": "Caches live outside the GLUE folder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Caches can be rebuilt. The browser keeps them in OPFS; GLUE Home keeps them keyed by profile, collection and song, and tidies them 5 minutes after start, then daily (ADR 0185)."}, {"id": "vault_system_profiles", "label": "Profiles: artist aliases of one library", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A profile is an artist alias. One GLUE folder has one library that every alias opens (ADRs 0113, 0114). A deleted profile is final everywhere."}, {"id": "vault_system_computer_shared", "label": "Shared collections across computers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Signed in with cloud sync on, one copy of each collection lives in GLUE Cloud in the shared form: each computer's music folders and its file copies, with analyses kept per computer (ADRs 0101, 0112, 0130)."}, {"id": "vault_system_shared_sync", "label": "Shared sync: snapshot, log and per-field merge", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GLUE Cloud keeps a snapshot and a log; merge3 merges per field; clashes wait in a box and a computer never clashes with itself (ADRs 0095, 0106, 0107, 0163)."}, {"id": "vault_system_home_engine", "label": "GLUE Home's Rust engine", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The engine does the library's work in Rust and writes the GLUE folder straight to disk, as the one writer of its files (ADRs 0152, 0153, 0154, 0160)."}, {"id": "vault_system_local_link", "label": "Local link on 127.0.0.1:47400-47409", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The website uses GLUE Home as its disk and engine over this link. Every route except hello and connect needs the token (ADR 0115, 0143, 0177)."}, {"id": "vault_system_home_mode", "label": "Home mode: the tab is GLUE Home's screen", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In Home mode the tab starts none of the library's work and releases the writer lease; its store sends every change to the engine as an op (ADRs 0125, 0162, 0163)."}, {"id": "vault_system_analysis_queue", "label": "Analysis queue: songs at a time, one pipeline", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Songs asked for now go first, then new songs' tags, then the library's songs, then thumbnails for other devices (ADR 0157). Failures are retried, and saved as failed after the third try (ADRs 0109, 0144)."}, {"id": "vault_system_native_audio", "label": "Native audio engine glue-audio", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The same analysis in Rust, a line-for-line port keeping JavaScript's numbers, held to the TypeScript results by goldens (ADRs 0147, 0148, 0149)."}, {"id": "vault_system_verdicts", "label": "Quality verdicts (Speklone forensics)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A hi-res file is judged by what reaches past 24 kHz above digital silence (ADR 0116). A steep lowpass with content above it is Lossless (ADR 0119). A rule change re-judges stored verdicts from the kept details, never the file (ADR 0166)."}, {"id": "vault_system_duplicates", "label": "Duplicates: fingerprints and names", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same recording by fingerprint, or artist and title within 3 s. Only copies of the same version count, and the best copy is the one shown and used (ADRs 0117, 0120, 0121, 0145, 0164, 0165)."}, {"id": "vault_system_cloud", "label": "GLUE Cloud: accounts, devices, signaling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Accounts hold collections, profiles and devices, never music. A device is a browser that holds music, a browser that only looks, or a GLUE Home (ADRs 0091, 0159)."}, {"id": "vault_system_dj_libraries", "label": "DJ libraries read in Rust (glue-interop)", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reads rekordbox XML, Traktor NML, Apple Music XML, Serato, Engine DJ and M3U as the website does (ADR 0167). Writes into a DJ app only through GLUE Home, opt-in per library, backup first, app closed (ADR 0168)."}, {"id": "vault_system_engine_dj_sync", "label": "Engine DJ kept in step both ways", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hot cues, loops and grid merged three ways against the last agreed values. Written only while Engine DJ and its analyser are not running, after a copy kept in dj-backups (ADRs 0170, 0172, 0173)."}, {"id": "vault_system_glue_playlists", "label": "GLUE's playlists mirrored into Engine DJ's GLUE folder", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A list without an origin is mirrored under a top-level GLUE folder in Engine DJ, merged three ways. Engine DJ playlists are imports, not merged (ADRs 0178, 0180)."}, {"id": "vault_system_streaming", "label": "Streaming songs to other devices over WebRTC", "file_type": "mechanism", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Signalled through GLUE Cloud; the song bytes go between the user's own computers. Sessions are kept per tab and other GLUE Homes only (ADRs 0133, 0150, 0174)."}, {"id": "vault_system_look", "label": "Look: theme table and Hallmark's Console treatment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No literal colour in a component: the theme table generates every theme's tokens and shared surfaces (ADRs 0028, 0191)."}, {"id": "vault_system_gluey", "label": "Gluey: tours as data and help articles", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tours point at data-guide parts of the UI. Help articles are src/help/*.md, one per feature; a feature's change updates its article and its tour (ADR 0126)."}, {"id": "vault_system_platform_access", "label": "OS access only through src/platform", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "OS access goes only through the browser's handles or GLUE Home's disk in Home mode (ADR 0007)."}, {"id": "vault_system_website_routes", "label": "Website routes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "vault_system_next_steps", "label": "Next steps: profile events, rekordbox XML export", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_system_how_glue_works", "target": "vault_system_pieces", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_how_glue_works", "target": "vault_system_glue_folder", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_how_glue_works", "target": "vault_system_look", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_pieces", "target": "vault_system_home_engine", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_pieces", "target": "vault_system_cloud", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_pieces", "target": "vault_adr_0104_glue_home_is_the_librarys_engine_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "vault_system_track_model", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "vault_system_caches", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "vault_system_profiles", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "src_store_collection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "src_store_home", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "src_store_fsx", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_glue_folder", "target": "vault_adr_0009_json_files_store_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_track_model", "target": "vault_system_away_folder", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_track_model", "target": "vault_system_no_file_relink", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_no_file_relink", "target": "src_core_library_relink", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_no_file_relink", "target": "src_lib_relink_svelte", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_no_file_relink", "target": "vault_adr_0124_no_file_songs_matched_and_linked_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_away_folder", "target": "vault_adr_0123_music_folders_that_come_and_go_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_caches", "target": "vault_adr_0185_the_cache_of_songs_that_left_is_tidied_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_caches", "target": "vault_system_home_engine", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_profiles", "target": "vault_adr_0113_profiles_are_the_accounts_aliases_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_profiles", "target": "vault_adr_0114_profiles_are_every_devices_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_computer_shared", "target": "vault_adr_0101_cloud_sync_is_the_accounts_collections_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_computer_shared", "target": "vault_adr_0112_the_accounts_collections_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_computer_shared", "target": "vault_adr_0130_same_file_on_two_computers_is_one_song_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_computer_shared", "target": "vault_adr_0108_one_id_per_computer_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_computer_shared", "target": "vault_adr_0161_no_own_form_into_a_shared_collection_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_computer_shared", "target": "src_core_shared_project", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "src_store_shared_engine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "crates_glue_engine_src_sync", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "src_lib_shared_svelte", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "vault_adr_0095_ask_per_clash_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "vault_adr_0106_shared_collection_as_a_snapshot_and_a_log_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "vault_adr_0107_sync_looks_only_at_what_changed_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "vault_adr_0155_the_shared_sync_in_rust_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/SYSTEM.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_system_shared_sync", "target": "vault_adr_0163_one_computer_never_clashes_with_it